OL,3,GNEWSAMum's surprise proposal on
OL,4,Afavourite rollercoaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum-of-two said a marriage proposal
OL,7,Fon her favourite rollercoaster ride had
OL,8,Fbeen "extra special".
OL,10,FNicolle Henderson's fiance Derek Cowan
OL,11,Fpopped the question on the Avalanche
OL,12,Fride - a steel bobsled ride at Pleasure
OL,13,FBeach Resort in Blackpool.
OL,15,FThe couple, from Scotland, have been
OL,16,Ftogether for three years and the staff
OL,17,Fmade sure they had the ride to
OL,18,Fthemselves under the pretence that
OL,19,FDerek, who is a mechanic, had been
OL,20,Fgiven permission to look at the ride's
OL,21,Fworkings.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
